A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.36.22; 
son of: Lotan (H3877); 
brother of: Hori (H2753H)
Another spelling of ho.mam (הוֹמָ֑ם "Hemam" H1950) 
§ Hemam = "exterminating"
a son of Lotan, brother of Hori, and grandson of Seir

A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ch.6.33; 
son of: Joel (H3100); 
father of: Bukkiah (H1232), Mattaniah (H4983H), Uzziel (H5816J), Shebuel (H7619H), Jerimoth (H3406L), Hananiah (H2608P), Hanani (H2607H), Eliathah (H0448), Giddalti (H1437), Romamti-ezer (H7320), Joshbekashah (H3436), Mallothi (H4413), Hothir (H1956), Mahazioth (H4238), Jehuel (H3171K), Shimei…
